WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:01.200
- Our kids are the same.

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.510
They're literally, constantly in costume.

00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:04.390
- They're constantly dressing up.

00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:07.270
And our kids are obsessed
with Wizard of Oz and Dorothy.

00:00:07.270 --> 00:00:09.970
So, they've been Dorothy every year.

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:11.565
So we're like, well this year--

00:00:11.565 --> 00:00:12.730
- That's financially awesome.

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:14.730
- Financially great.

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.930
But we're like let's you
know, maybe we could do

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:18.330
like a bloody Dorothy.

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:21.360
Like I can just put some
blood on you or something.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:22.640
'Cause really, Dorothy again?

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:23.510
You wanna like, you know.

00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:24.343
- But it's kind of awesome,

00:00:24.343 --> 00:00:26.230
'cause what my daughter did was tell me

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:27.830
she wanted to be Princess in Black,

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:28.840
we're reading these books.

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:30.350
There is no costume for that.

00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:32.360
I had to make it happen
and put it all together

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:33.721
with all of my free time, Eva.

00:00:33.721 --> 00:00:34.864
(laughing)

00:00:34.864 --> 00:00:36.830
And then, she was like
nevermind, I wanna be Anna.

00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:38.290
And I'm like,

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:39.763
and then I get Anna and she's like

00:00:39.763 --> 00:00:40.610
I don't know, Wonder Woman.

00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:43.120
I'm like, you're gonna wear it.

00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:46.420
I'm like my daughter changes
her mind all the time,

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:47.660
our five year old.

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:49.850
I would love it if she wanted
to be Dorothy every Halloween.

00:00:49.850 --> 00:00:50.700
- Every Halloween.

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:51.910
- [Kelly] That's magical.

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:52.800
- So, what's she going with?

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:53.633
You don't know?

00:00:53.633 --> 00:00:54.466
- I have no idea.

00:00:54.466 --> 00:00:56.120
She can wear a sheet for all I care

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:57.360
and be a ghost at this point.

00:00:57.360 --> 00:00:58.193
I am past it.

00:00:58.193 --> 00:01:00.370
- Are you the kind of mom,
like do you make the thing.

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:01.450
You don't
- Hell no.

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:03.230
I get on Etsy with all those mamas

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:04.746
that have time to make stuff.

00:01:04.746 --> 00:01:05.713
(laughing)

00:01:05.713 --> 00:01:06.671
- I'm with you.

